INSERT INTO exercises (id, course_id, topic_id, lesson_id, slug, type, title, prompt_md, code, code_language, expected_behavior_md, explanation_md, difficulty, grading_mode, settings, points, status, is_demo, updated_at) VALUES ('exe_3c7372637ac0e0a9', 'course_programming_applications', 'top_e57cde355af1cd13', 'les_acf2557a43d5a105', 'obj-value-popped-item', 'trace', 'Which item did pop() give back?', 'What is the value of `last` **when the last line runs**? Type the word only, without quotes.', 'items = ["pen"]
items.append("book")
items.insert(0, "bag")
items.sort()
last = items.pop()
print(len(items))', 'python', '', 'Follow the List object as each method changes it:

1. `["pen"]`
2. `append("book")` adds to the end: `["pen", "book"]`
3. `insert(0, "bag")` puts `"bag"` at index 0: `["bag", "pen", "book"]`
4. `sort()` puts them in alphabetical order: `["bag", "book", "pen"]`
5. `pop()` removes the last item and gives it back, so `last` is **pen**, and the List is left with `["bag", "book"]`.

