INSERT INTO exercises (id, course_id, topic_id, lesson_id, slug, type, title, prompt_md, code, code_language, expected_behavior_md, explanation_md, difficulty, grading_mode, settings, points, status, is_demo, updated_at) VALUES ('exe_1d0313c4467a3421', 'course_programming_fundamentals', 'top_e07719c8d778f2a7', 'les_e07719c8d778f2a7', 'final-m3-flow-count-the-shapes', 'mcq', 'How many shapes of each kind?', 'A student will draw the flowchart for this pseudocode, with **one shape for each step**, following the rules from the lecture.

```pseudocode
BEGIN
    INPUT length, width
    area ← length * width
    perimeter ← 2 * (length + width)
    IF area > 50 THEN
        PRINT "Big room"
    ELSE
        PRINT "Small room"
    END IF
    PRINT area, perimeter
END
```

Which statements about the finished flowchart are **true**? Pick **all** the true ones.', NULL, NULL, '', 'Each step becomes one shape:

| Step | Shape |
|---|---|
| `BEGIN`, `END` | 2 ovals (one Start, one End) |
| `INPUT length, width` | parallelogram |
| `area ← length * width` | rectangle |
| `perimeter ← 2 * (length + width)` | rectangle |
| `IF area > 50` | diamond, with YES and NO exits |
| `PRINT "Big room"` (YES path) | parallelogram |
| `PRINT "Small room"` (NO path) | parallelogram |
| `PRINT area, perimeter` | parallelogram |

So the chart has 2 ovals, 4 parallelograms, 2 rectangles and 1 diamond. Input and output always go in parallelograms, calculations in rectangles, and questions in diamonds. The two paths of the decision join again before `PRINT area, perimeter`, so the chart has a single End.', 'medium', 'auto', '{"reserved":true,"multiple":true,"shuffle":true}', 1, 'published', 0, 1791590400000) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET topic_id = excluded.topic_id, lesson_id = excluded.lesson_id, slug = excluded.slug, type = excluded.type, title = excluded.title, prompt_md = excluded.prompt_md, code = excluded.code, code_language = excluded.code_language, expected_behavior_md = excluded.expected_behavior_md, explanation_md = excluded.explanation_md, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, grading_mode = excluded.grading_mode, settings = excluded.settings, points = excluded.points, status = excluded.status, is_demo = excluded.is_demo, updated_at = excluded.updated_at;
